{"id":"pecora","lemma":"pecora","pos":"noun","rank":3804,"glosses":["sheep (animal)","ewe","its meat (raw or cooked), its skin or its fur"],"ipa":"/ˈpɛ.ko.ra/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"pecore","masculine":"pecoro"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f8/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-XANA000-pecora.wav","examples":[{"text":"\"Di chi sono queste pecore?\" \"Sono mie.\"","en":"\"Whose sheep are these?\" \"They are mine.\"","words":[{"g":"of"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"am / are","l":"essere"},{"g":"this, this one, these","l":"questo"},null,{"g":"am / are","l":"essere"},{"g":"mine","l":"mio"}]},{"text":"Sono la pecora nera della famiglia.","en":"I'm the black sheep of the family.","words":[{"g":"am / are","l":"essere"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"black","l":"nero"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"family"}]},{"text":"Ho visto delle pecore.","en":"I saw some sheep.","words":[{"g":"have","l":"avere"},{"g":"visa"},null,null]},{"text":"Sto portando queste pecore al mercato.","en":"I'm taking these sheep to the market.","words":[{"g":"to stay, remain","l":"stare"},{"g":"to bring","l":"portare"},{"g":"this, this one, these","l":"questo"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"market"}]},{"text":"È la pecora nera della famiglia.","en":"He's the black sheep of the family.","words":[{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"black","l":"nero"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"family"}]}]}